 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "All night we fished on Gennesaret and the nets came up bare",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He said put out into the deep and let them down from there",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So full of fish the nets were tearing, both boats began to sink",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I fell down at his knees and I could hardly speak or think",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Simon son of John, do you love me",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yes, Lord",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 2,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You know that I love you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Feed my lambs",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take care of my sheep",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow me, follow me",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the fourth watch of the night we saw him walking on the sea",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I asked him, call me out to you, and Come, he said to me",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I walked on the water till I saw how strong the wind could be",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then sinking down I cried, Lord, save me, and he reached his hand to me",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
